@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digidoclocker

state "Unregistered Citizen" as UnregisteredCitizen
state "Registered Citizen" as RegisteredCitizen
state "Logged In Citizen" as LoggedInCitizen
state "Registrars Requesting Certificate" as RegistrarsRequestingCertificate
state "Multiple Certificates Applied" as MultipleCertificatesApplied
state "Session Ended" as SessionEnded

UnregisteredCitizen : entry / Unregistered User
UnregisteredCitizen : do / Register Citizen
UnregisteredCitizen : exit / Registered Citizen

RegisteredCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : [Login]
LoggedInCitizen : entry / Correct Login Details
LoggedInCitizen : do / Upload Documents, View Profile or Apply for Certificate
LoggedInCitizen : exit / Continue Uploading Documents or Apply for Multiple Certificates

RegistrarsRequestingCertificate : entry / Request Certificate for Verification
RegistrarsRequestingCertificate : do / Request Multiple Certificates and Continue Requesting More
RegistrarsRequestingCertificate : exit / End Session

MultipleCertificatesApplied : entry / Applied for Multiple Certificates
MultipleCertificatesApplied : do / Reapply after Sending Request to Issuer
MultipleCertificatesApplied : exit / End Session

SessionEnded : entry / User Done with Actions
SessionEnded : do / End Session
SessionEnded : exit / [*]

[*] --> UnregisteredCitizen
UnregisteredCitizen --> RegisteredCitizen : [Register]
RegisteredCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : [Login]
LoggedInCitizen --> MultipleCertificatesApplied : [Apply for Certificate]
MultipleCertificatesApplied --> RegistrarsRequestingCertificate : [Reapply]
RegistrarsRequestingCertificate --> SessionEnded : [End Session]

@enduml
